{
  "vendor": "anyapi",
  "name": "AnyAPI",
  "category": "social",
  "summary": "One pay-per-call wallet in front of many data sources: social profiles, posts, comments and search across Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, X and Google.",
  "docs_url": "https://getanyapi.com/docs",
  "base_url": "https://api.getanyapi.com",
  "auth": {
    "credentials": {
      "api_key": {
        "env": [
          "ANYAPI_API_KEY"
        ],
        "description": "An AnyAPI key, billed from your USD wallet (getanyapi.com dashboard)"
      }
    },
    "inject": [
      {
        "in": "header",
        "name": "Authorization",
        "value": "Bearer {api_key}"
      }
    ]
  },
  "notes": [
    "Each operation is POST /v1/run/{sku} with a normalized JSON body; the catalog has hundreds of operations, this file names the social and search ones. GET /v1/apis/{sku} returns any operation's input schema and price.",
    "Every call is billed in USD from the wallet, a flat price per request (listed per endpoint). Reading the balance is free.",
    "Pagination: send the nextCursor of the previous response as cursor.",
    "Routing options (source, allowFallbacks, ignoreSources, preferLatencyUnderMs, requireFields) exist on every run call and are not listed here; the defaults pick the cheapest source."
  ],
  "sources": [
    "https://getanyapi.com/docs",
    "https://api.getanyapi.com/openapi.json"
  ],
  "curated": "2026-11-08",
  "endpoints": [
    {
      "id": "anyapi.facebook.profile",
      "name": "Get a Facebook page profile",
      "summary": "Public page details: likes, followers, category, about.",
      "kind": "read",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/run/facebook.profile",
      "params": {
        "handle": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Account handle, without @."
        },
        "url": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Full URL of the item."
        }
      },
      "job": "social.profile",
      "docs_url": "https://api.getanyapi.com/openapi.json",
      "verified": {
        "docs": "https://api.getanyapi.com/openapi.json"
      },
      "notes": [
        "A read over POST: every AnyAPI operation is a POST that only fetches data.",
        "Price: $1.20 per 1,000 requests (USD, billed from the wallet).",
        "Send at least one of: handle, url."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "anyapi.facebook.posts",
      "name": "List a Facebook page's posts",
